From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tyn-patches <tyn-patches@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:27:44 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] tyn: sg-pc time leap flip clock (0x41a140 / 0x41a960 /
 0x418d60)

10:3A starts the counter from the two times; it is drawn on the layer
GlobalVars[6702] from the script's EFF_TIMELEAP background with alpha
GlobalVars[6703] and zoom GlobalVars[6704]: month, day, weekday, hours and
minutes as flipping cells, the minutes blurred while the counter is fast.
Checked against Game.exe run in an emulator: the same sprite draws in every
frame of all time leaps of the script table.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

